  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/818/751/image_2024-03-04_102414885.png\" width=\"950\" height=\"336\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@FurtiTwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/985/youtube-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/k3fGJwJqzu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/987/discord-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffurtitwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/988/donate-png.png\" width=\"22%\" height=\"22%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/furti_two/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/986/curseforge-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ffurti-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/984/modrinth-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>Ender's Delight 是一款 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 擴充模組，讓你能夠利用在終界（End）發現的驚人資源，例如末影珍珠或合唱果實，來烹調美味佳餚。你也可以將末影人或潛影貝的肉加入食譜中，創造真正非凡的餐點。透過此模組，你將能突破 Minecraft 的烹飪極限，探索全新的美食維度。&nbsp;準備好去發掘終界獨特的風味、嘗試新食譜，並用你的烹飪技藝讓朋友們驚嘆不已吧！</strong></p>\n<p>透過終界生物的新掉落物，為你最愛的料理發現全新食材！使用「末影視界」（不穩定的末影人眼球，會發出耀眼的光芒）為料理增添閃耀效果。或者，加入「潛影貝軟體」（潛影貝堅硬外殼內的黏滑生物），為料理賦予獨特口感。如果想嘗試酥脆的口感，不妨試試「蟎蟲脆皮」（酥脆但氣味強烈的末影蟎皮膚）。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/818/753/image_2024-03-04_102524576.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/623/436/2023-02-15_22.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/623/437/2023-02-15_22.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre>你可以將 Ender's Delight 放入你的整合包中！<br><br></pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">你也可以看看我的其他模組：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useless-sword\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/416/64/64/637746702745178325.png\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutated-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1070/646/64/64/638606054091700999.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalwart-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/588/64/64/637853847063684188.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/657/638184557398425576.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/organics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/413/64/64/637746699816017646.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slimy-stuff\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1076/873/64/64/638614825744489631.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/724/578/64/64/638077506455486007.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frosted-friends\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/411/64/64/637746696852738455.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wandering-bags\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/689/759/64/64/638069994452394564.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves-torpedoes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/674/64/64/638476410476119618.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/depth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/720/638184653709126308.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/call-of-yucutan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1002/886/64/64/638523299285638581.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enders-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/779/326/64/64/638124003553252444.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sons-of-sins\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/109/sons_of_sins_logo_bis.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-confectionery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1158/779/64/64/638727280864889757.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1158/714/64/64/638727221391013276.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-logistics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1116/69/64/64/638670333200272317.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-weight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/734/378/64/64/638084439152506136.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/774/64/64/638476553282271633.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ninjaxxs-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/549/392/64/64/637886561525247638.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fuzes-relics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/580/980/64/64/637945482784615684.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-</p>",
